{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533780/extras/WTE_vision_gif.gif?t=1627057296\" /><br><br><strong>Challenging Auditory Platformer</strong><br>Take on the challenge of a platformer where the platforms are invisible. Use limited vision tools and distinct auditory cues to learn the layout of each puzzle and successfully maneuver through it. The combined factors of limited vision, precision platforming, and puzzle solving create a uniquely challenging platforming experience.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533780/extras/WTE_transformation_gif.gif?t=1627057296\" /><br><br><strong>Four Characters</strong><br>Swap between four different character &quot;memories&quot; which each offer a unique mechanic that allows you to complete various challenges.<br><br><strong>Light Story Elements</strong><br>Slowly uncover the story surrounding the player character\u2019s journey as you progress through the world.<br><br><strong>Other Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Original Soundtrack<br></li><li>Optional Collectable Item Challenges<br></li><li> Secret Ending</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1533780?t=1627057296","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1533780?t=1627057296","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533780/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1627057296","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533780/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1627057296","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta